# Implementation Plan: CaloriesTracker Live Web Demo with Docker & Demo Data

Deploy a fully functional, recruiter-friendly live web demo for **CaloriesTracker** featuring a containerized backend, pre-seeded food nutrition database, a 1-click guest/demo account with pre-loaded daily meal entries, and production-ready cross-origin settings.

---

