## 2. Proposed Changes

### Component 1: Database Seeding for Recruiters
Currently, seeding scripts exist separately in `prisma/scripts/` and only populate partial data. We need a unified, resilient seed script so the demo is instantly interactive.

#### [NEW] [seed_demo.ts](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/davidprz/projects/CaloriesTracker/backend/CaloriesTrackerBackend/prisma/scripts/seed_demo.ts)
- **Categorias & Medidas**: Populates all standard food categories and measurement units (grams, ml, cups, pieces, etc.).
- **Food Data Ingestion**: Loads common foods and FDC items with calories, carbs, fat, and protein directly into `Comida`.
- **Demo User Creation**:
  - Creates demo account: `demo@caloriestracker.com` (hashed bcrypt password `demo1234`).
  - Pre-populates daily meal history (`DataConsumo` & `DataConsumoDetalle`) for today and yesterday with realistic breakfast, lunch, and snack entries.
  - Ensures nutrition progress bars, macro circles, and calorie charts render immediately on first login.

