### Component 2: Dockerization (Backend & Full Stack)

#### [NEW] [Dockerfile](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/davidprz/projects/CaloriesTracker/backend/CaloriesTrackerBackend/Dockerfile)
- Multi-stage Node 22 build using `pnpm`.
- Installs dependencies, runs `prisma generate`, compiles TypeScript, and runs the server via `node` / `tsx`.
- Includes automated startup script that optionally runs `npx prisma migrate deploy` on boot.

#### [NEW] [docker-compose.yml](file:///wsl.localhost/Ubuntu/home/davidprz/projects/CaloriesTracker/docker-compose.yml)
- Root compose configuration defining:
  - `postgres`: Containerized database with persistent volume `pgdata`.
  - `backend`: Linked to `postgres`, with environment variables for port, JWT secret, and CORS.
  - `frontend`: Vite preview or Nginx container serving built static assets and proxying `/api`.
- Allows running the full live demo locally or on any VPS with a single `docker compose up --build`.

